msgid "Bookkeeping"
msgstr "Bokföring"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/apps.py:10
msgid ""
"Double-entry books with vouchers, journal and ledger, under Finnish rules."
msgstr ""
"Dubbel bokföring med verifikat, dagbok och huvudbok enligt finska regler."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/apps.py:36
#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/_nav.html:13
#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/posting_settings.html:3
#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/posting_settings.html:5
msgid "Bookkeeping of invoices"
msgstr "Bokföring av fakturor"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/apps.py:39
msgid ""
"The accounts and voucher series invoices and payments are booked to, and VAT."
msgstr ""
"Konton och verifikatserier som fakturor och betalningar bokförs på, samt "
"moms."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/apps.py:66
msgid ""
"The books have posted vouchers, which must be kept readable for the legal "
"period, so bookkeeping stays on."
msgstr ""
"Bokföringen har bokförda verifikat som ska hållas läsbara under den "
"lagstadgade tiden, så bokföringen kan inte stängas av."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/countries/fi.py:19
msgid "Finland"
msgstr "Finland"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/countries/fi.py:195
msgid "Association"
msgstr "Förening"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/countries/fi.py:197
msgid ""
"For a registered association (yhdistys): activities, fundraising and "
"membership fees, with a surplus or deficit."
msgstr ""
"För en registrerad förening (yhdistys): verksamhet, insamling och "
"medlemsavgifter, med överskott eller underskott."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/countries/fi.py:318
msgid "Cooperative or company"
msgstr "Andelslag eller bolag"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/countries/fi.py:320
msgid ""
"For a cooperative (osuuskunta), such as a water cooperative, or a company: "
"net sales, with a profit or loss."
msgstr ""
"För ett andelslag (osuuskunta), till exempel ett vattenandelslag, eller ett "
"bolag: omsättning, med vinst eller förlust."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/forms.py:75
#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_detail.html:13
msgid "Kind of organisation"
msgstr "Typ av organisation"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/forms.py:82
msgid ""
"Decides the form of the income statement and the chart of accounts the books "
"start with. Accounts can then be added, renamed and retired."
msgstr ""
"Avgör resultaträkningens form och den kontoplan bokföringen börjar med. "
"Konton kan sedan läggas till, döpas om och tas ur bruk."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/forms.py:101
msgid "The account has entries, so this stays."
msgstr "Kontot har bokföringsposter, så detta ändras inte."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/forms.py:131
msgid "No financial year covers this date."
msgstr "Ingen räkenskapsperiod omfattar detta datum."

