msgid "Start the books"
msgstr "Starta bokföringen"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/index.html:18
msgid ""
"Choose the first financial year and a chart of accounts. Then enter the "
"balances the year starts with (from last year's balance sheet) as the first "
"voucher, of the kind \"Opening balances\"."
msgstr ""
"Välj den första räkenskapsperioden och en kontoplan. Ange sedan de balanser "
"perioden börjar med (från fjolårets balansräkning) som det första "
"verifikatet, av slaget \"Ingående balans\"."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/index.html:31
msgid "The books have not been started yet, or no financial year is open."
msgstr ""
"Bokföringen har inte startats ännu, eller så finns ingen öppen "
"räkenskapsperiod."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/index.html:35
#, python-format
msgid "%(count)s posted voucher"
msgid_plural "%(count)s posted vouchers"
msgstr[0] "%(count)s bokfört verifikat"
msgstr[1] "%(count)s bokförda verifikat"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/index.html:39
msgid "Late entries"
msgstr "Sena bokföringar"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/index.html:40
msgid ""
"Entries are to be booked at the latest four months after the end of their "
"month, and cash payments day by day. These drafts are past that:"
msgstr ""
"Bokföringsposter ska bokföras senast fyra månader efter utgången av sin "
"månad, och kontantbetalningar dag för dag. Dessa utkast har passerat den "
"tiden:"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/index.html:50
